OL,3,GNEWSAKing Conker abdicates throne with
OL,4,A'great sadness'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe King Conker of the World Conker
OL,7,FChampionships has announced his
OL,8,Fretirement from the ceremonious role
OL,9,F"with great sadness".
OL,11,FDavid Jakins has undertaken the
OL,12,Fhonorary mascot job at the annual
OL,13,Fautumn event for the past two decades.
OL,15,FThe new king for Sunday's showdown in
OL,16,FNorthamptonshire will be Jim Packer,
OL,17,Fwith Jakins' daughter Fee Aylmore
OL,18,Fbecoming Queen Conker.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
