OL,3,GNEWSAKing Conker abdicates throne with
OL,4,A'great sadness'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJakins said: "It is with great sadness
OL,7,Fthat I step down from my role as King
OL,8,FConker after 20 wonderful years.
OL,9,FHowever, I am extremely pleased to pass
OL,10,Fthis role on to my daughter, Fee, who
OL,11,Fwill be a wonderful queen."
